2026-07-28 01:02:07.056 [http-nio-8081-exec-44] INFO  com.knockfish.aspect.LogAspect - [更新文章] 请求开始 - PUT /api/article - ArticleController.updateArticle - 参数: {"articleId":54,"title":"Vue 项目性能优化手段","cover":"","description":"","content":"# 构建层面优化\n## Gzip / Brotli 压缩\n\n通过 `vite-plugin-compression` 插件对构建产物进行双重压缩，大幅减小文件体积\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport viteCompression from 'vite-plugin-compression'\n\nplugins: [\n  // Gzip 压缩配置\n  viteCompression({\n    verbose: true,                  // 是否在控制台输出压缩结果\n    disable: false,                 // 是否禁用\n    algorithm: 'gzip',              // 压缩算法,可选 [ 'gzip' , 'brotliCompress' ,'deflate' , 'deflateRaw']\n    ext: '.gz',                     // 压缩后的文件名后缀\n    threshold: 10240,               // 只有大小大于该值的资源会被处理 10240B = 10KB\n    deleteOriginFile: false        // 压缩后是否删除原文件\n  }),\n\n  // Brotli 压缩配置\n  viteCompression({\n    verbose: true,\n    disable: false,\n    algorithm: 'brotliCompress',    // 使用 brotli 算法\n    ext: '.br',\n    threshold: 10240,\n    deleteOriginFile: false,\n  })\n]\n```\n**优化效果**：静态资源体积减少 60%-80%，显著降低网络传输时间","status":"DRAFT","publishTime":null,"updatedTime":"2026-07-28 00:12:13","fileIds":null,"tags":[7,30]}
